how_its_made:
This mobile social network was built using React for the Frontend, the Smart Contracts were programmed using Solidity and deployed in the Polygon Mumbai testnet using hardhat.

@Polygon We are using Polygon to deploy the contract that runs the application and mints the tickets NFT’s.

@IPFS & Filecoin NFT.storage: We are using IPFS Web3.storage to store the image of the gatherings posts and IPFS NFT.storage to store the NFT tickets bought by the users.

@Coinbase: We are using Coinbase to enable our users to log in and interact with our decentralized social network. After connecting with the wallet, the user can buy tickets for the gatherings they choose as NFT’s.
